{"id":"en_when-love-missed-its-moment","title":"When Love Missed Its Moment","titleEn":"When Love Missed Its Moment","description":"Howard Judd once married Willow Murphy in a previous life, only to discover that she treated him as nothing more than a blood bank for Simon Wade, her first love. The story follows Howard as he navigates the painful consequences of that betrayal and the lingering question of what might have been. Dramzio offers viewers a way to follow this series and its unfolding episodes.","poster":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_when-love-missed-its-moment/cover.jpg","backdrop":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_when-love-missed-its-moment/cover.jpg","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Modern","All-Too-Late","Rebirth","Billionaire","Toxic Love","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cs5km/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_when-love-missed-its-moment_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cs5km/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_when-love-missed-its-moment_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cs5km/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_when-love-missed-its-moment_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cs5km/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_when-love-missed-its-moment_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cs5km/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_when-love-missed-its-moment_5","